<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nouvelle vente</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#333;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f4f4f4;padding:40px 0;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#fff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background:#000;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
                            <h1 style="color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;">PLACEAUPRO</h1>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:32px;">
                            <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#222;">Bonne nouvelle{% if artist.firstname %}, {{ artist.firstname }}{% endif %} !</h2>
                            <p>Vous venez de réaliser une vente. Voici le détail des œuvres commandées :</p>

                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:24px 0;border-collapse:collapse;">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr style="background:#f8f8f8;">
                                        <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#555;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;">Œuvre</th>
                                        <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#555;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;">Qté</th>
                                        <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#555;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;">Prix unitaire</th>
                                        <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#555;border-bottom:2px solid #eee;">Sous-total</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    {% for item in items %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;">{{ item.title }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;text-align:center;">{{ item.quantity }}</td>
                                        <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;text-align:right;">{{ item.unitPrice|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                                        <td style="padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;text-align:right;">{{ item.lineTotal|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;color:#666;padding-right:8px;">Référence commande :</td>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;">#{{ order.reference }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;color:#666;padding-right:8px;">Date :</td>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;">{{ order.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;color:#666;padding-right:8px;">Acheteur :</td>
                                    <td style="font-size:13px;">{{ order.user.displayName }}</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:32px 0;">
                            <p style="font-size:12px;color:#999;">
                                Préparez vos œuvres pour l'expédition. Pour toute question, répondez à cet email en indiquant la référence de la commande.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background:#fafafa;padding:16px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#999;">
                            © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Placeaupro
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
